# Narrow whitespace rule for the two byte-faithful historical CVL derivatives.
# Original source whitespace is intentionally preserved; only the documented
# CVL2 mathint parameter signature differs. Do not disable checks globally.
# Keep blank-at-eof and space-before-tab checks enabled for both files.
/1.spec whitespace=-blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
/2.spec whitespace=-blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
